stitute their endorsement by CGIA or North Carolina State Government. Any sale of this data must not violate applicable state laws or regulations.</p><p><br></p>\\n\\n<h4>Website Citation</h4><p>When citing NC OneMap in printed or online publications please use the following citation:</p>\\n\\n<pre role=\\\"textbox\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\" aria-label=\\\"Code block (read only)\\\"><em>NC OneMap (2019)</em>. North Carolina Department of Information Technology, Government Data Analytics Center, Center for Geographic<br>Information and Analysis. Available at www.nconemap.gov.</pre><p>\\n</p>\",\"schemaVersion\":2.1}},\"width\":12,\"showEditor\":false}]}],\"visibility\":{\"access\":\"default\",\"groups\":[]}}]},\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-22T11:46:21.656Z\",\"updatedBy\":\"nconemap\"}}",
